{#
    Variables attendues : `heatmapData` (structure de WorkoutHeatmapService::build()),
    `regularityGoalOverview` (RegularityGoalOverview), `regularityGoalForm` (FormView de
    RegularityGoalType), `deloadPeriods` (list<DeloadPeriod>), `deloadForm` (FormView de DeloadPeriodType).
    Chaque carte à modale a sa propre instance de workout--list--modal.

    Le widget régularité n'est volontairement pas repris ici : il est déjà affiché sur le
    dashboard, le dupliquer sur cet onglet n'apporte rien.
#}
<div class="w-full max-w-[820px] mx-auto flex flex-col gap-5">
    {% include 'workout/list/_calendar/_heatmap.html.twig' with {'heatmapData': heatmapData} only %}

    <div data-controller="workout--list--modal">
        {% include 'workout/list/_calendar/_regularity_goal_management.html.twig' with {
            'overview': regularityGoalOverview,
            'form': regularityGoalForm,
        } only %}
    </div>

    <div data-controller="workout--list--modal">
        {% include 'workout/list/_calendar/_deload_management.html.twig' with {
            'deloadPeriods': deloadPeriods,
            'deloadForm': deloadForm,
        } only %}
    </div>
</div>
